# Keep browser-only Webflow scripts out of Apps Script deployments.
Webflow/**

# Admin-apps project (separate GAS project — has its own admin/.clasp.json)
admin/**

# Local/editor metadata
.vscode/**
.git/**
.gitignore

# Email design previews — browser-only mockups plus a Node renderer.
# NOT ignored until 2026-09-01, which meant every email-preview/*.html was being
# pushed into the Apps Script project as an HTML file. Harmless bloat on its own,
# but adding a .js renderer here would have been pushed as a SCRIPT file, and its
# top-level require('fs') would have thrown on every single execution — killing
# every trigger in the project. Keep this rule.
email-preview/**
